    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[0].dialogue
      value: Hi there, a nurse said you were asking for me?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[1].dialogue
      value: Yeah.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[2].dialogue
      value: "\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[3].dialogue
      value: "\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[3].isChoice
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[4].dialogue
      value: Are you feeling alright? You pressed your call button.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[5].dialogue
      value: I feel.. um..
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[5].isChoice
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[6].dialogue
      value: I'll tell the nurses, they can help you with that. A lot of people feel
        that way during treatment, so there's no need to worry.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[7].dialogue
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[8].dialogue
      value: Did you have another question?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[9].dialogue
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[10].dialogue
      value: You can ask me anything that's on your mind, it's okay.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[11].dialogue
      value: Why did I have to come back?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[11].isChoice
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[12].dialogue
      value: What do you mean?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[13].dialogue
      value: "Why am I still sick? You said I\u2019d get better when you treated
        the bad stuff in my blood, Mom said I would too."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[14].dialogue
      value: Treatment can take a long time. It takes a while for you to feel better.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[15].dialogue
      value: Do I have to take more medicine?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[16].dialogue
      value: "You do, but you\u2019ll be taking new kinds in a few days. One of your
        nurses said you hated taking all those pills, so that\u2019s a good thing,
        right?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[17].dialogue
      value: No more pills at all?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[18].dialogue
      value: "You\u2019ll still have some, but we\u2019re going to be using an IV."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[19].dialogue
      value: The needle thing?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[1].fontstyle
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[20].dialogue
      value: Yeah, you had one when you first came to visit us, remember?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[21].dialogue
      value: "\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[22].dialogue
      value: "I know it\u2019s scary, but it\u2019ll help you a lot."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[23].dialogue
      value: "But they hurt! I don\u2019t like them."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[24].dialogue
      value: "\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[25].dialogue
      value: Do you know what an IV does?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[26].dialogue
      value: <i>sniff<i> No...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[27].dialogue
      value: "An IV sends the medicine swimming up your arm and into your blood.
        It\u2019s really strong too. If you want, we\u2019ll even use the one with
        the butterfly on it so it won\u2019t hurt at all."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[28].dialogue
      value: "It\u2019s not a butterfly."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[29].dialogue
      value: What do you mean?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[2].fontstyle
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[30].dialogue
      value: "It\u2019s that fish on the wall."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[31].dialogue
      value: A stingray?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[31].isChoice
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[32].dialogue
      value: Yeah.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[33].dialogue
      value: Well, the stingray will help you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[34].dialogue
      value: Is it going to make me feel better?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[35].dialogue
      value: Soon.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[36].dialogue
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[37].dialogue
      value: "I\u2019ll tell you more about it tomorrow, okay?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[38].dialogue
      value: Okay... Bye Ms. Doctor.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7225383127061665974, guid: 78cfcc93a2da82a4584f48f9cc2f8a3c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneLine.Array.data[39].dialogue
      value: I'll see you soon, make sure you get some good sleep.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
